// being able to tag something with more information
// these can be used by the compiler or userland

@my_annotation
my_func :: () : void {

}

// having some runtime code that gets these annotation and does some check
//  or insertion of code etc.

// same for variables, expressions etc.
// it seems reasonable for most things to be annotationable
@my_annotation x: i4
// you might want to be notified when annotated things are declared
//  and used